'''Catclaw Championships''' (にゃんこ道検定, ''Nyankodō Kentei'', '''Cat's Path Test''') is a set of stages that appears in [[Catclaw Dojo]] after clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. Catclaw Championships consists of 12 maps unlocked after clearing certain [[Main Chapters Levels]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

==Overview==
Each Catclaw Championships map corresponds to a different [[Stage Difficulties|star difficulty]]. Clearing a map will turn all instances of that star pink after being cleared (e.g., clearing Catclaw Championships Rank 1 turns 1★ pink) and increase the player's '''rank''' (段位 ''[[wikipedia:Dan (rank)|dan]]''), which can be viewed in the [[Battle Cats Officers' Club]] menu. [[File:Pink EoC star.png|thumb|300px|[[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1's difficulty after clearing Catclaw Championships Rank 1]]

The first 9 Catclaw Championships maps function like tutorials for early-mid-game players, demonstrating key mechanics and strategies such as traits, meatshielding and certain [[Special Abilities|abilities]]. Some stages in the first 9 maps have  predetermined lineups, [[Cat Cannon]]s, [[Treasure]]s, upgrades and hints that can be viewed in the "Enemies Appearing" window. All stages in the first 9 maps have unique defeat messages that are shown upon losing. The last 3 maps function more like challenges for late-endgame players, with no conditions and greater rewards but much higher difficulty.

All Catclaw Championships stages are [[No Continues]], cost no [[Cat Energy|cat energy]] and have one-time rewards. Otherwise, they do not have the usual Dojo mechanics such as enemies not dropping money, and the enemy base is a harmless [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]] with finite HP instead of a [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]]. The total rewards for clearing Catclaw Championships include 280,000 XP, 30 [[Leadership]], 85 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]], 12 Rare Cat Tickets, 2 [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum Tickets]], 30 [[Catseye]]s [Dark] and 1 [[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Ticket]].

===Play Requirements===
The Catclaw Championships maps must be cleared in order; the only one available at first is Rank 1.
*Ranks 1, 2 and 3 are unlocked after beating Japan/Fukuoka in Empire of Cats Chapter 1.
*Ranks 4, 5 and 6 are unlocked after beating Empire of Cats Chapter 1.
*Rank 7 is unlocked after beating [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.
*Rank 8 is unlocked after beating Rank 7.
*Rank 9 is unlocked after obtaining 3 [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] from the main [[Legend Stages]].
*Rank 10 is unlocked after obtaining 5 Mythic Cats from the main Legend Stages.
*Rank 11 is unlocked after obtaining 7 Mythic Cats from the main Legend Stages.
*Rank 12 is unlocked after obtaining 10 Mythic Cats from the main Legend Stages.

:''Note: [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]] and [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]] do not count towards unlocking Ranks 9-12.''

